+### CherryPy
+
+Mount the static files
+
+```python
+import cherrypy
+from mapkick.cherrypy import mapkick_config
+
+class Root:
+    @cherrypy.expose
+    def index(self):
+        return 'Hello'
+
+cherrypy.tree.mount(Root(), '/', config=mapkick_config)
+```
+
+Load the JavaScript
+
+```html
+<script src="/static/mapkick/mapkick.bundle.js"></script>
+```
+
+Create a map in a route
+
+```python
+from mapkick.cherrypy import Map
+
+def index():
+    map = Map([{'latitude': 37.7829, 'longitude': -122.4190}])
+    return f'<html><body>{map}</body></html>'
+```
+
+And render it
+
+```html
 {{ map }}
 ```
 
